Universities are supposed to be places were lerning takes places.
Personally, I have learned a lot about Unix (as an example) from
reading init files and other documents in some other users' home
directories.  I also mostly have my directories open and won't mind
someone else reading or even copying my .cshrc or similar files.

I draw the limit to using the open files against someone.  I don't
