From caf-talk Caf May 31 15:33:10 1993
Subject:  Can you teach the law without breaking it?
Message-ID: <1993May31.154227.5699@wisipc.weizmann.ac.il>
From: oren@wisdom.weizmann.ac.il (Ben-Kiki Oren)
