A project group of mine was able to solve this problem in one instance
by asking the SysAdmins to create a Unix "group" (remember that middle
category in the file permissions?) consisting of our project members.
Combined with the RCS (Revision Control System), we were able to share
code files and give team members write permission without worrying about
clobbering each other's changes or having random other people read/erase
our files.

